  "summary": "整篇形式证明尚未通过 Lean Kernel；请查看原稿锚点、编译诊断和翻译缺口，不能据此判定原数学证明错误。",
  "sourceSteps": [
    {
      "id": "source-0",
      "index": 0,
      "role": "inference",
      "start": 186,
      "end": 220,
      "sourceExcerpt": "令 Y 为 BC 的垂直平分线与内心角平分线 AI 所在直线的交点。",
      "status": "translation_mapped_only",
      "kernelVerified": false,
      "sourcePositionsValid": true,
      "originalInferenceVerified": false,
      "sourceEquivalenceCertified": false,
      "leanWitnessMarker": "source_step_0",
      "dependsOn": []
    },
    {
      "id": "source-1",
      "index": 1,
      "role": "inference",
      "start": 220,
      "end": 239,
      "sourceExcerpt": "由于 YB=YC，∠YBC=∠BCY。",
      "status": "translation_mapped_only",
      "kernelVerified": false,
      "sourcePositionsValid": true,
      "originalInferenceVerified": false,
      "sourceEquivalenceCertified": false,
      "leanWitnessMarker": "source_step_1",
      "dependsOn": []
    },
    {
      "id": "source-2",
      "index": 2,
      "role": "inference",
      "start": 239,
      "end": 302,
      "sourceExcerpt": "由 BI、CI、AI 是三个内角平分线，结合内心角恒等式以及三角形内角和，使用有向角模 180° 追踪得 ∠YBI=∠YQC。",
      "status": "translation_mapped_only",
      "kernelVerified": false,
      "sourcePositionsValid": true,
      "originalInferenceVerified": false,
      "sourceEquivalenceCertified": false,
      "leanWitnessMarker": "source_step_2",
      "dependsOn": []
    },
    {
      "id": "source-3",
      "index": 3,
      "role": "inference",
      "start": 302,
      "end": 318,
      "sourceExcerpt": "因此 B,I,Q,Y 四点共圆。",
      "status": "translation_mapped_only",
      "kernelVerified": false,
      "sourcePositionsValid": true,
      "originalInferenceVerified": false,
      "sourceEquivalenceCertified": false,
      "leanWitnessMarker": "source_step_3",
      "dependsOn": []
    },
    {
      "id": "source-4",
      "index": 4,
      "role": "inference",
      "start": 318,
      "end": 347,
      "sourceExcerpt": "对称交换 B、C 后，同样得到 C,I,P,Y 四点共圆。",
      "status": "translation_mapped_only",
      "kernelVerified": false,
      "sourcePositionsValid": true,
      "originalInferenceVerified": false,
      "sourceEquivalenceCertified": false,
      "leanWitnessMarker": "source_step_4",
      "dependsOn": []
    },
    {
      "id": "source-5",
      "index": 5,
      "role": "inference",
      "start": 352,
      "end": 376,
      "sourceExcerpt": "因此 Y 同时属于 (BIQ) 和 (CIP)。",
      "status": "translation_mapped_only",
      "kernelVerified": false,
      "sourcePositionsValid": true,
      "originalInferenceVerified": false,
      "sourceEquivalenceCertified": false,
      "leanWitnessMarker": "source_step_5",
      "dependsOn": []
    },
    {
      "id": "source-6",
      "index": 6,
      "role": "inference",
      "start": 376,
      "end": 425,
      "sourceExcerpt": "两个圆的一个共同交点为 I，另一个共同交点为 X；Y 是不同于 I 的另一个公共点，所以 Y=X。",
      "status": "translation_mapped_only",
      "kernelVerified": false,
      "sourcePositionsValid": true,
      "originalInferenceVerified": false,
      "sourceEquivalenceCertified": false,
      "leanWitnessMarker": "source_step_6",
      "dependsOn": []
    },
    {
      "id": "source-7",
      "index": 7,
      "role": "inference",
      "start": 425,
      "end": 460,
      "sourceExcerpt": "特别地，A,I,X 共线，而 P,Q,X 均在 BC 的垂直平分线上。",
      "status": "translation_mapped_only",
      "kernelVerified": false,
      "sourcePositionsValid": true,
      "originalInferenceVerified": false,
      "sourceEquivalenceCertified": false,
      "leanWitnessMarker": "source_step_7",
      "dependsOn": []
    },
    {
      "id": "source-8",
      "index": 8,
      "role": "inference",
      "start": 465,
      "end": 502,
      "sourceExcerpt": "根据 X 位于 AI，以及 AI 平分 ∠BAC，有 ∠XAB=∠XAC。",
      "status": "translation_mapped_only",
      "kernelVerified": false,
      "sourcePositionsValid": true,
      "originalInferenceVerified": false,
      "sourceEquivalenceCertified": false,
      "leanWitnessMarker": "source_step_8",
      "dependsOn": []
    },
    {
      "id": "source-9",
      "index": 9,
      "role": "inference",
      "start": 502,
      "end": 539,
      "sourceExcerpt": "利用 X 位于 BC 垂直平分线得到 XB=XC，故 ∠XCB=∠XBC。",
      "status": "translation_mapped_only",
      "kernelVerified": false,
      "sourcePositionsValid": true,
      "originalInferenceVerified": false,
      "sourceEquivalenceCertified": false,
      "leanWitnessMarker": "source_step_9",
      "dependsOn": []
    },
    {
      "id": "source-10",
      "index": 10,
      "role": "inference",
      "start": 539,
      "end": 583,
      "sourceExcerpt": "又由 B,I,X,Q 共圆、C,I,X,P 共圆作圆周角变换，可得 ∠XCB=∠XAB。",
      "status": "translation_mapped_only",
      "kernelVerified": false,
      "sourcePositionsValid": true,
      "originalInferenceVerified": false,
      "sourceEquivalenceCertified": false,
      "leanWitnessMarker": "source_step_10",
      "dependsOn": []
    },
    {
      "id": "source-11",
      "index": 11,
      "role": "inference",
      "start": 583,
      "end": 635,
      "sourceExcerpt": "由圆切弦定理逆命题，直线 XC 在 C 处与圆 (ADC) 相切，其中 D 为 AX 与 BC 的交点。",
      "status": "translation_mapped_only",
      "kernelVerified": false,
      "sourcePositionsValid": true,
      "originalInferenceVerified": false,
      "sourceEquivalenceCertified": false,
      "leanWitnessMarker": "source_step_11",
      "dependsOn": []
    },
    {
      "id": "source-12",
      "index": 12,
      "role": "inference",
      "start": 635,
      "end": 654,
      "sourceExcerpt": "故切割线定理给出 XC²=XA·XD。",
      "status": "translation_mapped_only",
      "kernelVerified": false,
      "sourcePositionsValid": true,
      "originalInferenceVerified": false,
      "sourceEquivalenceCertified": false,
      "leanWitnessMarker": "source_step_12",
      "dependsOn": []
    },
    {
      "id": "source-13",
      "index": 13,
      "role": "inference",
      "start": 659,
      "end": 684,
      "sourceExcerpt": "由 C,I,P,X 四点共圆，∠XCI=∠XPI。",
      "status": "translation_mapped_only",
      "kernelVerified": false,
      "sourcePositionsValid": true,
      "originalInferenceVerified": false,
      "sourceEquivalenceCertified": false,
      "leanWitnessMarker": "source_step_13",
      "dependsOn": []
    },
    {
      "id": "source-14",
      "index": 14,
      "role": "inference",
      "start": 684,
      "end": 737,
      "sourceExcerpt": "由于 P、Q、X 共线并在 BC 垂直平分线上，使用 PB=PC 和夹角关系，可推得 ∠XCI=∠CPX。",
      "status": "translation_mapped_only",
      "kernelVerified": false,
      "sourcePositionsValid": true,
      "originalInferenceVerified": false,
      "sourceEquivalenceCertified": false,
      "leanWitnessMarker": "source_step_14",
      "dependsOn": []
    },
    {
      "id": "source-15",
      "index": 15,
      "role": "inference",
      "start": 737,
      "end": 795,
      "sourceExcerpt": "结合 C、I、Q 共线，圆切弦定理逆命题给出直线 XC 在 C 处与圆 (CPQ) 相切，因此 XC²=XP·XQ。",
      "status": "translation_mapped_only",
      "kernelVerified": false,
      "sourcePositionsValid": true,
      "originalInferenceVerified": false,
      "sourceEquivalenceCertified": false,
      "leanWitnessMarker": "source_step_15",
      "dependsOn": []
    },
    {
      "id": "source-16",
      "index": 16,
      "role": "inference",
      "start": 800,
      "end": 818,
      "sourceExcerpt": "两式合并得 XA·XD=XP·XQ。",
      "status": "translation_mapped_only",
      "kernelVerified": false,
      "sourcePositionsValid": true,
      "originalInferenceVerified": false,
      "sourceEquivalenceCertified": false,
      "leanWitnessMarker": "source_step_16",
      "dependsOn": []
    },
    {
      "id": "source-17",
      "index": 17,
      "role": "inference",
      "start": 818,
      "end": 861,
      "sourceExcerpt": "由于 A,D,X 共线以及 P,Q,X 共线，逆相交弦定理说明 A,D,P,Q 共圆。",
      "status": "translation_mapped_only",
      "kernelVerified": false,
      "sourcePositionsValid": true,
      "originalInferenceVerified": false,
      "sourceEquivalenceCertified": false,
      "leanWitnessMarker": "source_step_17",
      "dependsOn": []
    },
    {
      "id": "source-18",
      "index": 18,
      "role": "inference",
      "start": 861,
      "end": 878,
      "sourceExcerpt": "故 D 位于圆 (AQP)，证毕。",
      "status": "translation_mapped_only",
      "kernelVerified": false,
      "sourcePositionsValid": true,
      "originalInferenceVerified": false,
      "sourceEquivalenceCertified": false,
      "leanWitnessMarker": "source_step_18",
      "dependsOn": []
    }
  ],
